keywords:
  - binary analysis
  - opaque predicates
  - dead code elimination
  - reaching definitions
  - deobfuscation
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, tests, committed x86-64 corpora and experiment scripts for the
  manuscript "Dyn-Phi: A Trace-Informed Join Node for Triaging Opaque Predicates and Dead
  Branches in Binary Code". It evaluates execution-evidence annotated reaching definitions
  as a triage stage in front of a three-valued verifier, together with the controls that
  bound the contribution.
